==Battleground==
*10 [[Castle Guard (Enemy)|Castle Guards]] spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Castle Guard (Enemy)|Castle Guards]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Ashura (Enemy)|Ashura]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horsemen]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>.
*1 [[Ashura (Enemy)|Ashura]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Ashura (Enemy)|Ashura]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Castle Horseman (Enemy)|Castle Horsemen]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Cyclops (Enemy)|Cyclops]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Dragon Rider (Enemy)|Dragon Riders]] spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**8 [[Dragon Rider (Enemy)|Dragon Riders]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ashura (Enemy)|Ashuras]] spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Castle Guard (Enemy)|Castle Guards]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The easiest stage in [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Immortal Castle &amp; Dragon]]; however, the stage is still pretty difficult due to the enemies having somewhat high magnifications. Hard hitting units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can help beat this stage.

